# The shader baseline fixture has to be LF.
#
# `BUILDING_FRAG` is a template literal, and ECMAScript normalises CRLF to LF inside one, so the
# string is always LF whatever line endings the .ts file has on disk. With core.autocrlf true on this
# machine, the fixture would be checked out as CRLF without this line and the byte-for-byte
# comparison would fail for a reason unrelated to the shader.
*.glsl text eol=lf
